(text "TPS259470L provides per-port overcurrent protection and reverse-current blocking.\nFLT_N returns to the hub combined PRT_CTL/overcurrent pin. BC1.2 disabled. Connector selection/footprint pending." (at 596.2 793.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "17166de6-629d-5c68-9558-fa516bc1ae48"))
